(5060, 1588, 2, 210, '2021-04-14 01:12:37', '', NULL, 'Inactive', 'Thank you for your detailed request. Based on your request, you wanted to update your Sophos anti-virus. However, couldn\'t contact the server because our Sophos firewall already updated the features. The best practice that I can recommend, is that ignored running your Sophos anti-virus everyday. It is already automatic running at the back-end of our server and quarantined the virus before deleted it. It will not lost as long as your sophos anti-virus still in your computer. Hope it helps with your concern. Thank you!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5061, 1588, 2, 210, '2021-04-14 01:15:16', '', NULL, 'Active', 'Thank you for your detailed request. Based on your request, you wanted to update your Sophos anti-virus. However, couldn\'t contact the server because our Sophos firewall already updated the features. The best practice that I can recommend, is that ignored running your Sophos anti-virus everyday. It is already automatic running at the back-end of our server and quarantined the virus before deleted it. Your files will not be lost as long as your sophos anti-virus still on your computer. Hope it helps with your concern. Thank you!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
