(9807, 3133, 3, 492, '2022-04-21 04:11:00', 'The paper roller of the printer is defective. Recommended end user to contact the supplier of the said printer. Upon calling the supplier, \'film\' used during printing is exhausted to its life span. The supplier will replace the \'film\' when parts arrive.  Advise end user to use tray 2 to lessen paper jams while waiting for spare parts of the printer.', NULL, 'Active', 'The paper roller of the printer is defective. Recommended end user to contact the supplier of the said printer. Upon calling the supplier, \'film\' used during printing is exhausted to its life span. The supplier will replace the \'film\' when parts arrive.  Advise end user to use tray 2 to lessen paper jams while waiting for spare parts of the printer. DONE!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
