(9816, 3135, 3, 492, '2022-04-22 01:37:42', 'Upon inspection of the unit, the device is cluttered with bulky shredded paper. The device might have been used exceeding the advised number of shredded paper. I have inquired Mr. Cabangon about the best possible approach to repair, recommendable action would be to contact the supplier of the device so as to maximize warranty.', NULL, 'Active', 'Upon inspection of the unit, the device is cluttered with bulky shredded paper. The device might have been used exceeding the advised number of shredded paper. I have inquired Mr. Cabangon about the best possible approach to repair, recommendable action would be to contact the supplier of the device so as to maximize warranty. DONE!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
