(11101, 3559, 3, 492, '2022-08-23 01:38:06', 'With the abrupt turning off of the servers yesterday, internet connection was lost to the entire DOH premises. Thus, the connection with the network along with the laptops, desktops and printers could not be established. Advised end-user when there is no connection with the printer, save the document file for printing to PDF and plug the saved file in a flashdrive directly to the printer for rush printing. ', NULL, 'Active', 'With the abrupt turning off of the servers yesterday, internet connection was lost to the entire DOH premises. Thus, the connection with the network along with the laptops, desktops and printers could not be established. Advised end-user when there is no connection with the printer, save the document file for printing to PDF and plug the saved file in a flashdrive directly to the printer for rush printing. DONE!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(11102, 3562, 3, 492, '2022-08-23 02:27:08', 'Technical problem: 4 beeps when booting up desktop. Removed RAM and cleaned with an eraser along with the board. Proceed with boot up but scanning and repairing drive G. Advised end-user to wait until the procedure is done so as to avoid any more complications with the desktop.', NULL, 'Active', 'Technical problem: 4 beeps when booting up desktop. Removed RAM and cleaned with an eraser along with the board. Proceed with boot up but scanning and repairing drive G. Advised end-user to wait until the procedure is done so as to avoid any more complications with the desktop. DONE!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
