(12746, 4100, 3, 717, '2023-02-16 06:33:37', 'Model: Brother DCP-T710W\r\nProblem: Inkbox is full\r\nSolution: Reset inkbox\r\n\r\nProcedure how to reset (Brother DCP-T710W)\r\n\r\nReset Purge Count\r\n1. Press Menu > Mono > Menu > Machine error appear\r\n2. Press up arrow button to hit 8 press ok\r\n3. Press up arrow button to hit 0 press ok > Machine error code appear\r\n4. Press Mono > find FLUSHING > press ok and FLSBK # appear\r\n5. Press arrow up an enter 2 ok 7 ok 8 ok 3 ok > Purge set to 000000 > Press stop\r\n\r\n* If error again\r\n\r\nReset FLSBK\r\n1. Press Menu > Mono > Menu > Machine error appear\r\n2. Press up arrow button to hit 8 press ok\r\n3. Press up arrow button to hit 0 press ok > Machine error code appear\r\n4. Press Mono > find FLUSHING > press ok and FLSBK # appear\r\n5. Press arrow up an enter 2 ok 7 ok 8 ok 3 ok > FLSBK set to 000000 > Press stop\r\n7. Restart\r\n\r\n', NULL, 'Active', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
