(13722, 4398, 3, 492, '2023-04-26 00:42:17', 'Unit was retrieved from the client by my coworker, Mr. Baysa. Initial observation was all lights of the printer was blinking at once. Then, the unit was endorsed to me for further action. Upon pushing the power button, the power indicator would light up then vanish shortly after. Tried other power cables compatible with the printer to check if the cable was the problem but it wasn\'t. Removed the power supply unit of the printer, endorsed to Mr. Aldrin for further inspection and the PSU was only generating 1-2V of power instead of 42V which is needed by the printer.', NULL, 'Active', 'Recommend client to purchase power supply unit compatible with the printer to check if the power supply unit is the problem and not the motherboard', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
