(14607, 4612, 3, 492, '2023-06-26 13:15:11', 'Upon inspection, ink was leaking from inside the printer and colored printout was not clear no matter how much printhead cleaning. Opened the unit for cleaning of ink residue, removed waste ink pad to drain for excess ink. Suctioned printhead for any obstructing ink smear. Then after, printed test page for any progress. Same problem persists. In conclusion, waste ink pad and printhead recommended for replacement not guaranteeing optimum performance of the printer even after replacing said parts.', NULL, 'Active', 'Upon inspection, ink was leaking from inside the printer and colored printout was not clear no matter how much printhead cleaning. Opened the unit for cleaning of ink residue, removed waste ink pad to drain for excess ink. Suctioned printhead for any obstructing ink smear. Then after, printed test page for any progress. Same problem persists. In conclusion, waste ink pad and printhead recommended for replacement not guaranteeing optimum performance of the printer even after replacing said parts. DONE!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
