(16590, 5309, 3, 492, '2023-11-15 07:25:48', 'Request one - desktop with corrupted OS could not boot correctly. Reformatted OS to Windows 10 and updated drivers with Wazuh and Sophos Agent installed.\r\nRequest two - upon diagnosing by replacing its peripherals, main problem is that the video input attached to the motherboard is not working properly. By replacing the spare videocard to the unit, unit was able to boot up with no problems. Recommend end-user to place videocard to the desktop.', NULL, 'Active', 'Placed indications by using plaster tape with notes for future reference.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
