(16592, 5321, 3, 492, '2023-11-15 07:31:16', 'Upon inspection to the UPS and desktop unit, there was no loose cable. By turning on the UPS, the unit could not deliver power to the attached desktop unit. On checking the extension wire where the UPS was connected, the cable was detached. Endorsed concern to Mr. Mataro for immediate response. Upon replacing the cable, no concern was noticed with the desktop unit.', NULL, 'Active', 'Advised end-user to replace the extension wire cable where the UPS was connected.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
