(17619, 5644, 3, 492, '2024-01-17 08:14:13', 'Inspected unit was leaking ink from where the inkpad was installed. Removed cover then the inkpad container. Drained and cleaned the inkpad container from excess ink and let it dry for a few hours. Returned unit to client after drying the inkpad and printed test page to preview if all colors are visible.', NULL, 'Active', 'Expecting error may occur in the future due to inkpad must be replaced, not cleaned.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(17620, 5648, 3, 492, '2024-01-17 08:16:31', 'Removed the installed driver for Kyocera then proceeded to install the complete driver installer for Kyocera TASKAlfa 2200 with printing, scanning and faxing.', NULL, 'Active', 'Let client try and scan a page to determine actions made was successsful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
