(18169, 5794, 3, 492, '2024-02-14 08:31:19', 'Unit kept prompting the error when trying to connect to Wi-Fi: \"Wi-Fi is out of order. Please contact Epson Support with error code: 202620\" - Initial inspection would be that the network interface card of the unit is loose. After reattaching the network card, no errors could be experienced thereafter.', NULL, 'Active', 'Instructed end-user to be patient when trying to connect with Wi-Fi.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
