(18531, 5932, 3, 492, '2024-03-04 08:21:25', 'Initial setup of EPSON L5290 by placing ink to the ink tank and removing the tape holding the unit in place. Then, ink initialization of the printer to the printer heads. Setup of wireless network by connecting to the network - CHD_Employee with IP address 192.168.3.52.', NULL, 'Active', 'Several other end-users have requested to connect to the said printer via a wireless network.', 1, 340, NULL, 'PRN08-HSDS-25', 'X8H5145800'),
(18532, 5931, 3, 492, '2024-03-04 08:27:42', 'The first action was to confirm the error was with the printer\'s driver by printing a sample page. It keeps prompting that the sample page cannot be printed on the unit. Uninstalled and reinstalled printer driver EPSON L3110, rebooted the system unit, and tried the first method. To no avail, the error kept prompting for the same. Tried installing driverpack to confirm if there were missing drivers on the system unit, but the problem persisted. Thereafter, tried rebooting the printer spooler by accessing the administrator user profile. Still, the problem could not be resolved.', NULL, 'Active', 'Advised client to transfer access with a different system unit to the printer as the system unit has software issues with the said printer.', 39, 394, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
