(20278, 6505, 3, 717, '2024-06-05 03:46:00', '1. Check physical connection\r\n2. Check network settings\r\n3. Disable and Re-enable Network Adapter\r\n4. Check for IP Address Issues\r\n5. Update Network Drivers\r\n6. Reset Network Settings\r\n7. Check Firewall and Security Software\r\n\r\nCause: \r\nSophos endpoint protection detect malware that cause blockage of network connectivity\r\n\r\nAction taken: \r\nDelete suspected malware file and update settings in Sophos cloud', NULL, 'Active', '', 27, 27, NULL, '08DT-HRMU-11', ''),
