(20288, 6507, 3, 717, '2024-06-05 08:57:37', 'Cause: \r\nFound out that the mac address is registered in ruijie cloud but not sync to Access Point\r\n\r\nAction Taken:\r\n1. Login to Ruijie Cloud\r\n2. Select Project name (Main-Network)\r\n3. Click Devices\r\n4. Search and select Access Point which end user is near then on the \"Config Status\" click sync\r\n5. Find \"Wireless blocklist/allowlist Settings Based on SSID\"\r\n6. In the right side click \"Manually Deliver\"\r\n7. Close Config Status and wait for the Access Point sync all the mac address registered in Ruijie Cloud', NULL, 'Active', '', 42, 992, NULL, '08LT-KCArbasFHU', ''),
