(21175, 6792, 3, 492, '2024-07-18 03:15:29', 'Upon initial inspection, by printing a test page to the problematic printer, an error would pop up that the connection was not configured. Tried removing the printer driver and installing it again on the desktop computer, then rebooting thereafter. Updated the computer\'s system drivers, reset the printer spooler service, and restored the printer\'s settings to default. Still to no avail, the error persisted. Tried printing using the problematic printer on a different desktop computer, and the test page was printed with no errors. In conclusion, the operating system may lack components with printing via USB cable.', NULL, 'Active', 'Request client to update operating system to a lower version - Windows 10 Pro. ', 79, 178, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
