(21309, 6836, 3, 786, '2024-07-25 01:25:58', 'Not functional mouse due to defective USB port\r\n\r\nAction taken: Remove the mouse from the defective USB port and transfer to another USB port.', NULL, 'Active', '', 95, 615, NULL, '08DT-HRMU-03', ''),
(21310, 6837, 3, 786, '2024-07-25 01:45:11', 'The main problem is not printing properly and the error message indicates \"There may be foreign material or torn paper inside the printer\"\r\n\r\nAction taken: Remove the cover of the printer and check the inside of the printer, There are some objects inside the printer that make the error message display, remove the objects and clean the sensor to be functional, conduct also a \"print head cleaning\" to properly print and remove the line printing output.', NULL, 'Active', '', 79, 615, NULL, '08PRN-HRMU-04', ''),
