(21519, 6906, 3, 492, '2024-08-09 00:18:13', 'Upon inspecting the unit, the toner cartridge used was neither genuine nor authentic and was manufactured by an unknown supplier other than HP. The toner was emitting only from the center of the cartridge so the printout was only focused on the center of the paper and no text was printed out. Had to replace the toner cartridge with the same supplier but with fewer defects. The only problem now was the paper jam due to small pieces of paper stuck on the paper rollers.', NULL, 'Active', 'It is not recommended to supply toner cartridges outside of the original manufacturer\'s specifications. There is a higher percentage that the unit can have defects once installed with a non-genuine cartridge.', 9, 553, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
(21520, 6908, 1, 962, '2024-08-09 02:08:04', NULL, NULL, 'Active', '', NULL, 992, NULL, '', ''),
(21521, 6909, 1, 962, '2024-08-09 02:37:17', NULL, NULL, 'Active', '', NULL, 888, NULL, '', ''),
(21522, 6907, 3, 492, '2024-08-09 02:37:23', 'Paper jams are due to the excess toner residue on the paper roller. Had to wipe off excess toner from the paper roller on trays one and two with a wet towel.', NULL, 'Active', 'Printed test page to verify if action made was successful. There are smudges on the paper due to the toner not meeting the genuine or exact specifications of the printer manufacturer.', 5, 553, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
