(21534, 6910, 3, 492, '2024-08-09 08:30:37', 'Initially, test page printed had smudges or unclear printout. Conducted printhead cleaning a few times until the colors had a clear printout from smudges. Updated firmware of the printer unit to the latest version through the internet.', NULL, 'Active', 'Printed another test page to view clear printout of colors from the printer.', 9, 824, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
(21535, 6912, 3, 492, '2024-08-09 08:34:02', 'The installed printer network settings on the laptop unit of the client were outdated and had an incorrect IP address for the printer. Removed the previously installed network settings and installed the correct network settings of the printer with the static IP address 192.168.4.32.', NULL, 'Active', 'Printed test page to confirm network connection from the laptop to the printer unit.', 75, 183, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
