(21640, 6933, 3, 492, '2024-08-16 03:00:54', 'Inspected unit is under PBSP jurisdiction. Actions taken were updating drivers, cleaning cache and program data, removing temporary data and cleaning the internals of the desktop unit from dust. Of all those actions taken, no improvements were achieved due to the HDD was failing and lacking RAM for optimizing application tasks.', NULL, 'Active', 'Upon rebooting, a prompt would pop-up that the HDD could not conduct the SMART protocol necessary for HDD\'s health and performance.', 14, 880, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
