(21704, 6946, 3, 492, '2024-08-20 00:06:41', 'Client\'s problem is the desktop unit is performing slow even in bootup. The said desktop unit is donated by PBSP, with outdated OS and MS Office as of date. Countermeasures conducted was to update OS, remove temporary files, clear cache and browsing history of all browsers and disable auto start applications. Still, no improvements was achieved due to HDD was failing and needs replacement.', NULL, 'Active', 'Client has provided an SSD for formatting and installation of new OS and MS Office then the sophos agent was also installed. After installation, returned the desktop unit to their office at CDU for pickup by schistosomiasis personnel.', 14, 880, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
