(21721, 6961, 3, 786, '2024-08-20 03:34:40', 'Concern: Desktop Connectivity issues\r\n\r\n\r\nAction Taken:\r\n-Identify the IP address of the printer\r\n-Download the drivers for the specific printer version and model\r\n-install the drivers for the printer on the desktop\r\n-input the IP address of the printer to connect the desktop to the printer\r\n-conduct test print to test the desktop if it is already connected to the printer\r\n-the desktop-to-printer is now connected', NULL, 'Active', '', 75, 183, NULL, '08PRN-FHU-11', ''),
