(21763, 6976, 3, 492, '2024-08-22 05:13:22', 'Upon printing the test page, the printer software prompted that there is a paper jammed within the printer. Inspecting the unit, there is a row of staple wire and a piece of crumpled paper stuck within the printhead. Upon removing the jam, there are no print output. Several printhead cleaning was conducted before the print output was clear.', NULL, 'Active', 'Upon returning the printer to the client, a test page was printed to show successful technical assistance. ', 5, 564, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
(21764, 6981, 3, 492, '2024-08-22 05:56:13', 'The client\'s concern is that by scanning through the ADF, the paper was undetected. Upon inspection, there are several masking tape blocking the ADF feeder unto the scanner sensor that prompts the printer to error. Upon removing the masking tape, normal scanning was restored.', NULL, 'Active', 'Sample scanning was conducted to show output of successful technical assistance.', 79, 708, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
