(21768, 6950, 3, 786, '2024-08-27 01:15:59', 'Concern: Slow performance of the unit\r\n\r\n\r\nAction Taken:\r\n-Remove HHD from the PC\r\n-Install the SSD to the PC\r\n-Install the Operating System on the PC\r\n-install other software and Microsoft Office \r\n-copy/paste the documents from the HHD', NULL, 'Active', '', 14, 575, NULL, '08DT-ACCT-12', ''),
(21769, 6987, 3, 492, '2024-08-27 01:25:50', 'Upon booting the UPS of the client, no power could be displayed. Removed the power cords from the computer unit and monitor but the problem still persists. Tried to change the fuse on the UPS, but it is still fine with no visible short-circuit marks. Brought the UPS to Mr. Mataro of GSS for further inspection, he concluded that the problem is the mosfet of the UPS which is transmitting the power from the power cord unto the battery.', NULL, 'Active', 'Placed remarks using masking tape and marker pen on what the is the problem of the UPS. An inspection report will be provided and be returned to MMS due to a hardware defect.', 11, 91, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
(21770, 6988, 1, 962, '2024-08-27 01:28:17', NULL, NULL, 'Active', '', NULL, 237, NULL, '', ''),
