(21772, 6988, 3, 492, '2024-08-27 02:28:51', 'Upon acquiring the static IP address of the printer, tried accessing the printer through the google chrome browser to validate connection of the printer to the DOH EV CHD network. Then upon printing a test page through the client\'s laptop, there is an established connection between the two.', NULL, 'Active', 'No problems encountered with the printer\'s connection to the DOH network.', 75, 237, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
