(21785, 6992, 3, 492, '2024-08-28 00:06:33', 'The requesting client had some trouble with charging her laptop after the intermittent brownout with the office. Tried plugging the charger with another electrical port to see if anything changes, but the problem still remained. Endorsed the charger to Mr. Mataro of the GSS to see if there are any problems with it. After checking, the charger has defect. Then after that, returned the charger to the client and recommended to replace the charger with a new one rather fixing it.', NULL, 'Active', 'The laptop unit has no defect and is in good working condition.', 59, 582, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
