(21943, 7044, 3, 492, '2024-09-04 05:11:09', 'Client requested to transfer printer that was originally being utilized by Mr. Bacsal of the Accounting unit, the Brother DCP-T710DW to the staff house for the new employees of Accounting-MAIFIP. Asked permission from their head of the Accounting office to be able to transfer the printer. After confirmation, unit was transferred and setup to the client\'s office and configured the laptop using the printer\'s static IP address.', NULL, 'Active', 'Printed test page to confirm connection of laptop to the printer.', 1, 938, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
