(21998, 7052, 3, 786, '2024-09-06 07:23:48', 'Concern: The printer has leek of ink \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\naction taken:\r\n-Pull out the printer\r\n-Open the ink tank on the right side of the printer\r\n-get all the ink pads then clean and remove all the ink, stock on the ink tank to clean\r\n-after cleaning the ink dry the ink to pads to install back on the printer\r\n-conduct test print for testing processing \r\n-the printer is now good working condition', NULL, 'Active', '', 16, 825, NULL, '', ''),
