(22200, 7112, 3, 492, '2024-09-18 01:37:28', 'Initial inspection performed by the GIP and intern at the ICTU with recommendations to upgrade HDD to SSD. With the unavailability of SSD, the performance of the unit would not improve. To be able to improve the unit\'s performance, the actions provided were: first, disabled the startup applications installed within the unit except the endpoint protection and the security application of Windows. Second, repair the registries by utilizing the Ccleaner application with the administrator privileges. Third, repair the operating system\'s corrupt files, then proceed to update their drivers with the Windows Update. Finally, updated the Windows and MS Office license. Rebooted multiple times to implement the settings update.', NULL, 'Active', 'Gathered feedback from end-user if the performance has improved.', 14, 615, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
