(22687, 7283, 3, 492, '2024-10-11 04:11:14', 'Computer could not connect to their office\'s network printer due to incorrect IP address. The intern then proceeded to update the IP address assigned to the computer\'s settings.', NULL, 'Active', 'After the intern\'s action taken, the client can now print to their network printer.', 75, 531, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
(22688, 7286, 3, 492, '2024-10-11 04:14:43', 'When the client decides to scan documents through the printer\'s software installed on the computer, the application would not perform the task. Upon inspection of the intern, the application\'s configuration for the network printer\'s scanner is incorrect. Updated the configuration aligned with the network printer\'s settings.', NULL, 'Active', 'Client can now scan after the actions taken.', 77, 865, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
