(22930, 7365, 3, 492, '2024-10-29 04:01:08', 'The client accompanied their visitor from RHU Jaro for the WiFi connection here at DOH EV CHD. The connectivity shall be used for their training for ELMIS as per the client.', '00:00:00:00:00:00', 'Active', 'Validity of the Guest voucher code is for one day and one device only .', 92, 820, 'APPROVE', 'N/A', 'N/A'),
(22931, 7366, 3, 492, '2024-10-29 04:05:15', 'The GIP and intern of the ICTU went to the client\'s office to provide technical assistance regarding their request. They noticed that there is power in the laptop\'s LEDs but no display. To solve this issue, they proceeded to reboot the system by holding down the power button until no power could be seen on the LEDs and pushing the power button again.', NULL, 'Active', 'Actions taken resolved the problem as the client can now utilize the laptop.', 34, 668, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
(22932, 7367, 3, 492, '2024-10-29 04:18:08', 'The GIP and intern of the ICT unit went to the client\'s office to provide technical assistance. Upon arrival, the client introduced them to a new printer to be enrolled in the DOH EV CHD network for wireless printing and installation of printer driver. Printer has been enrolled to the SSID: CHDEV-Printer with static IP address 192.168.4.29.', NULL, 'Active', 'Acquired the printer\'s brand, model, MR user, end-user, MAC address, and static IP address to be enrolled to the ITE-PM System.', 1, 183, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
(22933, 7368, 3, 492, '2024-10-29 06:31:59', 'The GIP and intern went to the client\'s office to provide technical assistance regarding their request. The client requested to print wirelessly to their office printer, but the unit has no feature to connect to a network. Instead, they installed the printer driver specifically for MacBook through the USB cable.', NULL, 'Active', 'Printed test page to affirm connectivity of MacBook to the printer.', 75, 350, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
