(23031, 7346, 3, 492, '2024-11-05 01:01:41', 'Retrieved the printer unit from the end-user\'s office for further technical assistance due to ink overflow. After cleaning the waste inkpad, black print output would not show. Conducted intensive printhead cleaning to verify the problem. After several printhead cleaning, the problem still persisted. Started cleaning the ink tubes and the black ink repository\'s funnel then wiped off any excess ink within the printer. After the actions conducted, all colors are now visible and clear print output.', NULL, 'Active', 'Exhausted much of the ink due to several printhead cleaning. Advised end-user to refill the inks utilized to prevent damage to the printheads.', 9, 341, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
(23032, 7403, 1, 962, '2024-11-05 01:04:43', NULL, NULL, 'Inactive', '', NULL, 1095, NULL, '', ''),
(23033, 7375, 3, 492, '2024-11-05 01:11:08', 'Upon arriving at the EVMC compound where the RESU resides, the personnel present have informed me that the printer indicated for technical assistance is for replacement of its maintenance box which is for EPSON L14150. By then, they have requested to connect their available laptops to their existing printers, EPSON L565 and Brother DCP-T700W, with static IP addresses. Before connecting their laptops to the printer, EPSON L565, the printer had to be connected to the EVMC SSID, DOH-HPU due to there was no connection of the printer to any SSID of EVMC for wireless printing. EPSON L565 had the static IP address: 192.168.230.238 while the Brother DCP-T700W had the static IP address: 192.168.230.241. Then after that, with the HFDU, installed the printer\'s static IP address to one of their personnel\'s laptop.', NULL, 'Active', 'Renamed printer names installed to their laptops to their office name for clearer indication of where the unit is.', 2, 469, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
