(23055, 7410, 3, 449, '2024-11-05 06:04:54', 'Virtual Pre-Meeting on MASS CASUALTY MANAGEMENT TRAINING OF FACILITATORS (MCM-TOF) for HEMS staff, HEMB, and Core Facilitators.\r\nHosted by DOH EVCHD ICTU\r\n\r\nhttps://doh.webex.com/doh/j.php?MTID=m9f0c36fb0d99ceaa6449bb423e06ac65\r\nFriday, November 8, 2024 1:00 PM | 4 hours | (UTC+08:00) Kuala Lumpur, Singapore\r\nMeeting number: 2510 705 7915\r\nPassword: 3AuVwPZRF28\r\n\r\nJoin by video system\r\nDial 25107057915@doh.webex.com\r\nYou can also dial 210.4.202.4 and enter your meeting number.\r\n\r\nJoin by phone\r\n+65-6703-6949 Singapore Toll\r\n\r\nAccess code: 251 070 57915', NULL, 'Active', '', 16, 502, NULL, '', ''),
(23056, 7409, 3, 786, '2024-11-05 07:22:56', 'Problem with PC to printer connection\r\n-upon checking the printer connection is a USB chord remove all the drivers from the PC\r\n-try to connect the chord again and test if the their is a connection\r\n-since it is not connected use a other option connect it using IP address to print\r\n-conduct test print to identify if their is a connection between PC to Printer', NULL, 'Active', '', 57, 615, NULL, '08DT-HRMU-01', ''),
(23057, 7407, 3, 786, '2024-11-05 07:32:54', 'A problem encountered is all the wireless connections have been disabled\r\n-retest all the printers if it is all connected\r\n-identified that the access point in the area has automatically restarted\r\n-then all the wireless connections have automatically connected after restarting the access point\r\n\r\nAnother problem encountered is that one of their printers has a problem with paper-feeding\r\n-check and identify what is the problem of the printer in paper feeding\r\n-after checking we identified that the unit had already been damaged\r\n-the paper roller is already defective and not functional', NULL, 'Active', '', 8, 915, NULL, 'N/A', ''),
