(23147, 7439, 3, 786, '2024-11-13 02:58:06', 'The problem encountered is printing smudge and the waste ink tank is leaking \r\n-after further inspection, the waste ink tank needs to be cleaned, and change the ink pad\r\n-remove the waste ink tank on the printer wash and clean the ink pad, and remove all the ink using running water\r\n-after washing dry up the ink pad to use again and return to the printer\r\n-since the printer has a smudge printing clean the paper roller on the printer\r\n-then conduct a test print to identify if the printing is good \r\n-since the printer is now in good working condition return it to the end user', NULL, 'Active', '', 9, 355, NULL, 'PRN08-HSDS-14', ''),
