(23165, 7438, 3, 786, '2024-11-15 01:25:51', 'concerned encountered a blue screen and a corrupted operating system\r\n\r\n-conduct an inspection for the problem encountered by the PC and identify the main problem of the PC.\r\n-since it did not proceed to the main windows it is always looping to the repair boot, conducted a process of installation for a new operating system\r\n-Install Windows 10 to the PC and back up all the files on the hard drive\r\n-install all the necessary software on the PC and driver software\r\n-after installing copy all the backup files on the hard drive\r\n-since we encountered a problem with the payroll system, we conducted a troubleshooting with the help of Sir Gino to repair the software and not remove all the saved file\r\n-since the PC and all the software are now in good working condition return the unit to the end user', NULL, 'Active', '', 55, 145, NULL, '08DT-PDOHO LEYTE-02', ''),
