(24354, 7813, 3, 218, '2025-02-05 00:56:59', 'Created govmail account', NULL, 'Active', 'Your request to create a GovMail account has been processed. Please note that all official communications and documents must be conducted exclusively through this account. For security purposes, the use of this account for enrollment or registration on social media and other platforms is strictly prohibited.\r\n\r\nYour GovMail account details are as follows:\r\nEmail: maip.biliran@ro8.doh.gov.ph\r\nSystem-Generated Password: DrnVNLBJ43r97aG*\r\n\r\nPlease copy and paste the system-generated password to log in, and then change it to your desired password. Note: The system-generated password is valid for three (3) days only. Please ensure you access your account within this timeframe.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, kindly provide your mobile number to enable two-factor authentication (2FA) for enhanced security.\r\n\r\nThank you for your attention and compliance.', 28, 749, NULL, '', ''),
