(24362, 7833, 3, 492, '2025-02-05 02:58:07', 'The client reported that yesterday, before this request, the desktop computer booted up properly. By inspecting the unit, there was no power being displayed after replacing the power cables. Furthermore, after jumping the PSU to check if there are any problems with the cable or the power adapter, in conclusion, the PSU is defective.', NULL, 'Active', 'Endorsed the PSU to Mr. Mataro of the GSU for further inspection and recommended repair if possible. Returned the desktop computer to cashiering for storage until a replacement PSU is available.', 11, 440, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
