(24372, 7837, 3, 492, '2025-02-05 06:32:12', 'After removing the printer drivers installed from the list of programs, removing the application printer installed from the control panel list, installing the right and complete drivers for the printer, and multiple reboots, the problem still persisted. No problem can be reviewed with the printer unit but with the desktop computer. No issues would arise it from other laptop or desktop will print the same documents.', NULL, 'Active', 'Recommend client to reset desktop computer to refresh its drivers and settings.', 78, 553, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
