(24385, 7739, 3, 492, '2025-02-06 01:17:33', 'Upon initial boot-up, it took too long to power up and proceeded directly to Windows\' startup repair. Then, after another bootup, the HDD was corrupted and could no longer load the operating system. To be able to retrieve the files from the corrupted HDD, I had to manually remove it from the computer and perform manual chkdsk using Windows\' administrator prompt to find and repair bad clusters of the HDD. An external HDD was provided by the client to backup the files needed from the corrupted HDD. An SSD was offered as replacement for the corrupted HDD to not hinder their operations.', NULL, 'Active', 'An inspection report was furnished for the replacement of the HDD to SSD. MR Employee has to sign on the inventory logbook to transfer the SSD to her possession. ', 11, 1017, NULL, '08DT-HSDS-08', 'SGH733TGHT'),
