(24512, 7886, 3, 492, '2025-02-12 02:11:23', 'Upon checking the client\'s computer through the printer\'s properties, \"Pause Print Jobs\" was ticked. In which it should be disabled for it will halt all print jobs from that computer.', NULL, 'Active', 'Advised client to have patience when printing from their shared printer as multiple users have access to that printer. ', 4, 320, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
