(26753, 8618, 3, 492, '2025-06-03 03:26:57', 'After numerous IP address and DNS renewal using cmd-administrator, there seems to be a problem with the IP address auto-configuration. To provide a solution, set the IP address configuration to static with 192.168.8.254 as the IP, 192.168.8.1 as the default gateway and 192.168.2.3 as the preferred DNS and 192.168.2.4 as the alternative.', NULL, 'Active', 'Desktop computer can now browse the local intranet and the internet after setting the cofiguration settings.', 66, 209, NULL, '08DT-GSU-10', 'N/A'),
