(26933, 8676, 3, 717, '2025-06-17 05:09:59', 'Rejoin the computer to the domain\r\n1. Log in locally (as a local admin, not a domain user).\r\n2. Remove from the domain:\r\n3. Press Win + R, type sysdm.cpl, and go to the Computer Name tab.\r\n4. Click Change, select Workgroup, and enter a temporary name (e.g., WORKGROUP).\r\n5. Restart the computer when prompted.\r\n\r\nRejoin the domain:\r\n1. Log back in as a local admin.\r\n2. Open sysdm.cpl again, click Change, and re-enter the domain name.\r\n3. Provide credentials for a domain admin when prompted.\r\n4. Restart the computer.', NULL, 'Active', '', 68, 575, NULL, '08DT-ACCT-09', ''),
