(26969, 8685, 3, 717, '2025-06-18 08:38:30', '1. Rejoin the Domain \r\n2. Log in as a local admin (not domain user).\r\n3. Open System Properties:\r\n4. Press Win + R, type sysdm.cpl > Change (under Computer Name tab).\r\n5. Select Workgroup, enter TEMP, then restart.\r\n6. After reboot, rejoin the domain:\r\n7. Repeat Step 2, but select Domain and enter your domain name (e.g., corp.local).\r\n8. Enter domain admin credentials when prompted.\r\n9. Restart again.', NULL, 'Active', '', 68, 1151, NULL, '08DT-ACCT-12', ''),
