(27197, 8755, 3, 492, '2025-07-01 08:36:10', 'The client reported that the laptop made strange noises coming from the internal fan. Upon checking, the system unit was operational, and with further inspection, by disassembling the components and monitoring the unit while active, the CPU fan was operational.', NULL, 'Active', 'Suggested client to elevate the back cover of the laptop where the fan is located every once in a while to mitigate the internal heat coming from the CPU. ', 54, 340, NULL, 'N/A', 'N/A'),
(27198, 8760, 3, 492, '2025-07-01 08:38:27', 'Repaired system files and registries using CMD administrator and ccleaner. Then, updated Windows system using Windows update.', NULL, 'Active', 'Monitored the system unit after a while to see if the problem resurfaces once again.', 55, 910, NULL, '08DT-RLED-02', 'N/A'),
