(28666, 9198, 3, 449, '2025-10-14 00:53:58', 'An inspection report was created. I disassembled the printer and removed the power supply, as it may be the defective component causing the device to have no power. I provided the power supply to the client and advised them to first attempt an initial repair through GSS, as it might still be repairable. If not, the client can then proceed to purchase a new power supply', NULL, 'Active', '', 75, 617, NULL, '08PRN-CASH-12', ''),
(28667, 9243, 3, 449, '2025-10-14 01:01:12', 'I received this as a result of a lapse, since the request was made on the day I was traveling. \r\n\r\nconducted a software installation for the printer, as the client\'s device did not have the proper printer driver installed. As a result, the print output was garbled or consisted only of random characters.', NULL, 'Active', '', 18, 775, NULL, '08DT-LEGAL-03', ''),
