(28910, 9329, 3, 786, '2025-10-30 08:39:41', 'Printer leakage problem\r\n-Open the cover of the printer\r\n-Upon checking, the printer leakage is in the ink tank of the printer\r\n-Upon verification, it was observed that the printer’s ink bottle had no cover, which caused the ink bottle to leak during refilling', NULL, 'Active', '', 9, 1046, NULL, 'NONE', ''),
