(29395, 9475, 3, 786, '2025-11-27 07:53:23', 'Printer leaking\r\n-Check the problem\r\n-Waste ink tank is already full\r\n-Remove the waste ink tank and clean using running water\r\n-Dry the ink pad\r\n-Conduct a test print for the printing output color\r\n-Since the output is incorrect, conduct print head cleaning 3x\r\n-Upon checking inside the printer, there is a paper clip inside the printer\r\n-Remove the paper clip and conduct print head cleaning', NULL, 'Active', '', 9, 340, NULL, 'NONE', ''),
