(1396, 28, 29, 0, '09052205811', '', 'I have a concern regarding a delivery to our section.  \r\n\r\nThe Requisition and Issue Slip needs my signature being the end-user.  The entry on the RIS states the following:\r\n\r\n               INK (GENERAL SERVICES)\r\n               BROTHER MFC - L5900DW\r\n               (DRUM UNIT - DR - 3455) (DOH-EV-CHD8) \r\n\r\nNow, we have called the attention of MMS that what we have received are under spare parts of the printer in our section.  They told us that what was delivered to us is under the classification of INK  in our office system.\r\n\r\nCould the system administrator please correct these particular fields in the system as follows:\r\n\r\n               INK is classified under office supplies while DRUM UNIT  should be classified as  a SPARE PART of an equipment which in this case is the  BROTHER MULTI-FUNCTION COPIER in our section.\r\n\r\nI hope this matter will be given scrutiny and consideration for continuous improvements of our office systems.\r\n\r\nThank you very much.', '2021-03-04 03:21:01', 'Inactive', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL),
