(4155, 195, 73, 0, '09124694446', 'doh.region8.eoh@gmail.com', 'Good day po, we are requesting the following items to input in the PMIS. Thank you\r\n\r\n1. To change price of Sterilizing and Disinfecting Solution from Php1,800 to Php1,900\r\n\r\n2. To input the following item as new:\r\na. Chlorine Granules, 65-70% Calcium Hypochlorite, pack of 3kls : unit cost @Php650/pack\r\n\r\nb. Sterilizing and Disinfecting Tablet\r\nSpecifications: \r\n-Active Ingredient: Sodium Dichoroisocyanurate(NaDCC)\r\n-Effervescent tablet based on Sodium Bicarbonate\r\n-NaDCC content per tablet: 1.86g or 1,860mg (93%)\r\n-Weight: 2.0g/tablet\r\n-Packaging: 200 tablets/400grams/canister\r\n-Physical State: Solid\r\n-Apperance: white, round flat tablet\r\n-Odor: Slight chlorine odor\r\n-Liberates Hypochlorous Acid (HOCI) upon contact with water\r\n-Available Chlorine (AVCL), 52%\r\n-Imprinted in red color \" Philippines Government Property-DOH-Not for Sale\'\' in individual canister\r\n\r\nc. Infectious Cadaver Bag for Adult  unit cost @Php1,501/bag\r\nSpecifications: \r\n>With 4 stronghold carrying strap on each side size of strap is 1 1/2\'\' width, length is approximately 26\'\' color of strap is white C-shaped opening with heavy duty zipper with lock size of zipper is 8\'\' color: white pocket ID with build identification pocket on the opposite side, thick transparent plastic, size of the ID pocket (length is 10\'\', with is 8\'\') with white zipper lock on top of the pocket, and white piping around the pocket \r\n>EPA chlorine free burn requirements for incineration type of disposal. Infectious disease remains can be cremated without transfer to another chlorine free pouch.  \r\n>Size: 123cm x 245cm\r\n >Type of heavy material: heavy duty, non-porous, leak proof plastic\r\n>Item Color: Black with DOH Logo\r\n>Packaging instruction: standard packaging of the manufacturer', '2023-03-03 06:13:41', 'Inactive', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL),
