(4665, 18, 19, 0, '09174995547', 'clarelle.laboga@ro8.doh.ro8.gov.ph', 'Dear ICTU:\r\n\r\nThis has reference to Notice from the DOH Central Office on the 2023 Implementation of the Report Card Survey (RCS) 2.0 (1st Cycle) wherein the DOH-EVCH- is included in the roster of agencies for the said survey. \r\n\r\nIn this relation, the DOH-EVCHD was requested to submit the following information:\r\n1.  List of the office’s two hundred (200) most recent external clients. These clients must have availed and completed an external service this 2023. \r\n2. Three (3) recommended external services of the agency for the conduct of the survey, with the largest number of transactions received and/or processed in 2022.\r\n\r\nFor compliance of the required information, we respectfully request the assistance of the ICTU to prepare a google form which shall be used in gathering information from all service provider based on Citizens\' Charter. A copy of the printed EXCEL reflecting the information needed was forwarded to your benevolent office as reference.\r\n\r\nThank you and cordial regards\r\n\r\nLSU', '2023-06-20 05:05:07', 'Active', 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL),
