(5696, 579, 599, 0, '09164256197', 'narcisa.zeta@ro8.doh.gov.ph', 'I would like to request access to the internet on my mobile phone. I believe that having internet access on my mobile device would significantly contribute to my efficiency and effectiveness in carrying out my responsibilities like enabling me to stay connected with our clients, and stakeholders in real-time. \r\nI understand that responsible use of resources is essential, and I assure you that I will use the internet access for work-related purposes only. I am willing to comply with any guidelines or restrictions set by the organization regarding mobile internet usage.\r\n\r\nI appreciate your consideration of this request and would be happy to discuss any additional details or address concerns you may have. Thank you for your time and attention to this matter.', '2024-01-25 01:45:49', 'Active', 6, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL),
