(9194, 271, 272, 0, '09274610909', '', 'Subject: Urgent Technical Assistance Request – eNGAS System Internet Dependency\r\n\r\nGood afternoon,\r\n\r\nWe are requesting immediate technical assistance regarding the eNGAS system, which is currently not functioning without an internet connection. Previously, the system was not internet-dependent and could be used offline without issue.\r\n\r\nThis change is causing significant disruption, especially considering the volume of transactions we need to process and the limited time available to prepare reports for the Commission on Audit (COA). If this issue is not resolved promptly, it may lead to serious delays in the submission of mandated reports.\r\n\r\nWe respectfully urge your immediate attention to this matter. Thank you for your support and prompt response.', '2025-10-01 06:50:32', 'Active', 5, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 4, 117),
